  "steps": [
    "Cake: beat the butter and sugar until pale and fluffy, whisk in the eggs, milk and vanilla, then fold in the flour.",
    "In an oven-safe pan over medium heat, melt the butter until foamy, stir in the brown sugar (whisk in a splash of boiling water if it splits).",
    "On low heat, lay the bananas cut-side down, then turn off the heat and spoon the batter over without mixing it into the caramel.",
    "Bake 35 minutes at 170 °C, flip onto a plate and serve with ice cream."
